[h2]Build 0.9.22[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Loaders can take from a passing belt.[/b] Put a Loader's gripper on a main line and a side-line belt behind it, and it lifts off only what the machines on the side line still need (counting what is already on its way); everything else rides on. Handy for feeding one machine's own loop from a shared main line.
[*][b]Return leftovers[/b] works for these too: surplus on the side line that nothing on it needs any more is put back onto the main line.
[/list]
